机的正面评语；3. 自动登录：恢复登陆页面的「两周之内不必登录」选项，每次打开教务系统后不用重复登录；4. 均分绩点计算器：可以直接看到自己的全部均分、全部绩点与必修均分、必修绩点，还可以自由选择自己需要的课程进行计算；5. 培养方案查询：可以方便地查询全校所有专业的培养方案与指导性教学计划，并且可以选择任意两个培养方案进行比较，查看差异；6. 成绩查询：可以方便地查询到本学期课程成绩的最高分、最低分、平均分和名次。", "fork": false, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/frederick-wang/scu-urp-assistant", "archive_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/frederick-wang/scu-urp-assistant/{archive_format}{/ref}", "assignees_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/frederick-wang/scu-urp-assistant/assignees{/user}", "blobs_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/frederick-wang/scu-urp-assistant/git/blobs{/sha}", "branches_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/frederick-wang/scu-urp-assistant/branches{/branch}", "collaborators_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/frederick-wang/scu-urp-assistant/collaborators{/collaborator}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/frederick-wang/scu-urp-assistant/comments{/number}", "commits_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/frederick-wang/scu-urp-assistant/commits{/sha}", "compare_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/frederick-wang/scu-urp-assistant/compare/{base}...{head}", "contents_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/frederick-wang/scu-urp-assistant/contents/{+path}", "contributors_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/frederick-wang/scu-urp-assistant/contributors", "deployments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/frederick-wang/scu-urp-assistant/deployments", "downloads_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/frederick-wang/scu-urp-assistant/downloads", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/frederick-wang/scu-urp-assistant/events", "forks_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/frederick-wang/scu-urp-assistant/forks", "git_commits_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/frederick-wang/scu-urp-assistant/git/commits{/sha}", "git_refs_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/frederick-wang/scu-urp-assistant/git/refs{/sha}", "git_tags_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/frederick-wang/scu-urp-assistant/git/tags{/sha}", "hooks_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/fr